  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, Star Lord Wan Xiang’s will sells three star path killer moves; the second is spring star rain. Activation needs large numbers of star rain Gu, small numbers of spring wind Gu, some star shoot Gu, and other Gu. Wan Xiang created it personally and prices it at one and a half immortal essence stones because few Gu Immortals have bought it.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_star_rain_gu",
        "gu_spring_wind_gu",
        "gu_star_shoot_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, buying as Eight Arm Immortal, wants it for star fragment grass that feeds starlight fireflies. He notices star shoot Gu is consumable and sold only by Wan Xiang, turning a one-time purchase into ongoing trade. Wan Xiang refuses to sell a star shoot Gu recipe, claiming natural birth in Myriad Star blessed land. Fang Yuan pays two immortal essence stones for spring star rain plus enough star shoot Gu for ten activations.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_eight_arm_immortal",
        "loc_myriad_star_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He tries the move once and finds it very effective; star shoot Gu remains necessary each time.",
      "chapters": [
        671
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later notes repeat the same assembly (large numbers of star rain Gu, small numbers of spring wind Gu, and other Gu) and that he uses it many times to nourish star fragment grass while still buying star shoot Gu from Wan Xiang.",
      "chapters": [
        711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After he owns Star Form blessed land, the grassland in the sky of Hu Immortal blessed land keeps its scale largely through repeated casts of this mortal killer move, which consumes large numbers of star shoot Gu. With star shoot Immortal Gu, he can use spring star rain freely and raise it to an immortal killer move with that Gu as the core to further raise star fragment grass yield. Star Form land spirit says Wan Xiang already held the immortal killer move spring star rain; the sold mortal version is a simplified form, and the sold star shoot Gu are refined with star shoot Immortal Gu, which is why reverse-deducing the recipe is hard.",
      "chapters": [
        852
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-upgrade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "gu_star_shoot_immortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After he gains the star path inheritance and star shoot Immortal Gu, several casts make the star fragment grass fields grow quickly, and the immortal killer move’s effect is dozens of times better than before.",
      "chapters": [
        902
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yield-increase",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
